      "content": "\"goblin's delight\" and \"goblin's growl\"? i've never heard those terms in any HVAC manual or training i've ever done. are you telling me those are actual technical terms for pressure drops and mechanical vibrations? \n\nplease stop with the weird analogies and just finish the list. you didn't finish point 3 regarding the sudden performance drops and the refrigerant pressure fluctuations. i need the actual mechanical causes for that.",
